    "title": "Mingo Job Corps offering free career training to eligible young adults and teens - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brian Heisserer ,\n10 hours ago PUXICO, Mo. (KFVS) - Mingo Job Corps is accepting applications from young adults who are seeking no-cost career training in skilled trades. To be eligible for the training, an applicant must be between the ages of 16 and 24 from low-income households. The program is free of charge for the students. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
